            <span>Admin pages, staff tools, and other restricted areas require specific access levels. Contact your supervisor if you believe you should have access.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="err-cause">
          <div class="err-cause-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.6" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
