            <span>For security, sessions end automatically after a period of inactivity. Signing in again usually resolves this.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ========== ACTIONS ========== -->
      <div class="err-actions">
        <a href="/sign-in" class="err-btn err-btn-primary">
